# ============================================================================
# QUICK START GUIDE
# ============================================================================
# 
# MINIMUM SETUP (to see the theme working):
# - No configuration needed! The theme is already applied.
# - The app will show configuration messages for missing services.
#
# TO ENABLE VOICE QUERIES:
# 1. Get OpenRouter API key (for AI responses)
# 2. Get Sarvam AI or ElevenLabs key (for voice-to-text)
# 3. Get MongoDB Atlas connection string (for vector search)
# 4. Add all keys above
# 5. Restart dev server: npm run dev
#
# TO ENABLE TEXT QUERIES ONLY:
# 1. Get OpenRouter API key
# 2. Get MongoDB Atlas connection string
# 3. Add both keys above
# 4. Restart dev server
#
# See SETUP_GUIDE.md for detailed instructions
# ============================================================================
